  "note": "The catalog assigns the same set of forms to several keys. Psalm 69:9 is the Hophal participle of estrangement. The pressing of wounds in Isaiah 1:6 belongs to the squeezing verb. How the rim, the wound and the striding creature relate historically is uncertain."
